{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシフィコ横浜にて一昨日と昨日と握手会したよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１日目は全国握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんとペアだったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんはまあやとのペア好き！\nまあやとがいい！って言ってくれるしうれしい\n(๑°꒵°๑)･*♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやもいくちゃんファンの方み～んなあったかくて笑顔も心も素敵な方が多くて楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お世話になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は個別握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の方が来てくださって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日もあったということでレーンがすっごい事になってて夢の国だったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:78F22DCD57FEB0E0025E510C68B9A57D-03@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛されてるなぁ～(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と我ながら思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に毎回毎回！いつもいつも支えてもらってばっかりで...感謝してもしきれません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の誕生日ブログも１０００件を超える沢山のお祝いメッセージ嬉しかったしびっくりしちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから生誕祭でも言ったように今年は沢山恩返しができたらなぁ～って思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんと親も見に来てて...皆さんが声援をくれたから\nめっちゃ恥ずかしがってたけどお母さんとも写真撮りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんは案の定泣いてましたよ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣かない！って決めてたみたいだけど...(๑́•∀•๑̀)ฅﾃﾍ-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんもちーちゃんもろってぃーもお手紙ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして個別に連絡くれたさゆにゃん、真夏、ちーちゃん、ひなちま、ひめたん、かずみん...とかとか沢山ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんなとケーキも食べれて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な幸せそうなまあやの写真を..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0020.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＴＶ乃木坂工事中見てくれたかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたぁ？\nいくちゃん、まあや、ちーちゃんの三人で催眠術にかかってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうね、ほんっっっとにすごい☆～⌒☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初恐怖心が少しあったんだけど、とっても楽しくなって\n私も最初催眠術疑ってたんですけど\n本当にかかるんだ！って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして久しぶりに番組でブリッジして歩きました(＊´∀｀人)(人´∀｀＊)テへペロ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0024.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかまあやだけ手の形が違うね...苦笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてヤンマガさんにもソログラビアに出させていただくので楽しみ✺◟(∗❛ัᴗ❛ั∗)◞✺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして5月6日発売の雑誌ボムにも\nひめたん！きぃちゃん！まあや！かりんちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:78F22DCD57FEB0E0025E510C68B9A57D-03@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あれ？なんか途中から文字大きくなってる..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みぃてねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして新レギュラーＴＶ番組\nのぎえいご！がまあや、あみちゃん、ひなちゃん、きぃちゃんの四人で始まるので是非是非見て下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田まあやの得意な英語"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見逃しなく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0030.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(めっちゃ幸せそうに微笑んでます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして気づいたかな？乃木天生配信の時はカーディガン黄色だったんだけど全く同じはなんだか嫌だったので個握の時は赤にして髪型も変えたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥とアサイーたべたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にご飯食べに行ってお泊りもした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ笑ったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあそぼーね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/04/0094478/0033.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n